  "Tsukihime remake in a browser": "在浏览器中运行的月姬重制版",
  "This is the Tsukihime remake, Tsukihime -A piece of blue glass moon-, running in a web page. There is no emulator and no native code here: the game's engine was rewritten in JavaScript and WebGL2, and that new engine plays the game's own scripts, pictures, voices and music.": "这是月姬重制版《月姬 -A piece of blue glass moon-》在网页中运行的版本。这里没有模拟器，也没有原生代码：游戏引擎用 JavaScript 和 WebGL2 重写，由这个新引擎播放游戏原本的脚本、图像、语音和音乐。",
  "It grew out of a Windows and Linux port made by recompiling the Nintendo Switch executable. That native build became the reference for this one. Whenever the browser version had to decide how something should look, sound or move, the answer was taken from the game.": "它源于一个通过重新编译 Nintendo Switch 可执行文件而制作的 Windows 和 Linux 移植版。那个原生版本成为了这个版本的参照。每当浏览器版需要决定某样东西该怎样显示、发声或运动时，答案都取自游戏本身。",
