  "The sections below explain how it was built. This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project, not affiliated with TYPE-MOON or Aniplex.": "下面的各节说明了它是如何制作的。这是一个非官方、非商业的粉丝项目，与 TYPE-MOON 和 Aniplex 无关。",
  "The source, on GitHub": "源代码（GitHub）",
  "Everything this was made with is in one repository: the engine rewritten in JavaScript and WebGL2, the tools that turned the game's files into what this page plays, the tests, and the notes on how each part was checked against the game itself.": "制作它所用的一切都在一个仓库里：用 JavaScript 和 WebGL2 重写的引擎、把游戏文件转换成本页可播放内容的工具、测试，以及每个部分如何与游戏本身核对的记录。",
  "The game: its engine, its interface and its styles.": "游戏本身：引擎、界面和样式。",
