  "The server is a small Python file with no dependencies, there only to hand files to the browser.": "服务器是一个没有依赖的小型 Python 文件，只用来把文件交给浏览器。",
  "Checking it against the game": "与游戏对照检查",
  "Reading the code was only the start. Findings read from the listing are often right and sometimes not, so changes were compared with the real game running.": "阅读代码只是开始。从指令清单读出的结论往往是对的，但有时不是，所以每处改动都与实际运行的游戏进行了比较。",
  "The native side": "原生一侧",
  "The PC build runs headless in a sandbox with scripted button presses, dumping every frame and recording its sound. A patch layer replaces the first script with any test scene, so one command can be measured alone. A moving mark on screen acts as a clock, giving the game's exact tick on every frame.": "PC 版在沙盒中以无界面方式运行，配合脚本化的按键操作，导出每一帧并录下声音。一个补丁层可以把第一个脚本替换成任意测试场景，因此可以单独测量一条命令。屏幕上一个移动的标记充当时钟，在每一帧上给出游戏的精确时刻。",
  "The browser side": "浏览器一侧",
  "The port is stepped on a virtual clock, one 60 Hz frame at a time, and compared with the native frames: positions, alpha, colour, letter by letter.": "移植版在虚拟时钟上以 60 Hz 一帧一帧地推进，并与原生画面比较：位置、透明度、颜色，逐字比对。",
  "text and script fixes re-run on native frames: 19 matched, 6 corrected": "项文本和脚本修正在原生画面上复查：19 项一致，6 项已更正",
